	(text "The I²C addresses are identical to BMG160. \nThe default I²C address of the device is 0b1101000 (0x68). \nIt is used if the SDO pin is pulled to ´GND´. \nThe alternative address 0b1101001 (0x69) is selected by pulling the SDO pin to ´VDDIO´."
